{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4rKsHLowsik5fPped7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathered by centuries of wind and waiting. A single iron keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the threshold. The tumblers turn — not just metal, but something older, something that remembers.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor of cool stone air, the scent of rain that hasn't fallen yet, and a light that doesn't come from any sun you know.*\n\n*You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}